# Deprecated Cursor entry point

Generic agent instructions now live in [.agents/AGENTS.md](.agents/AGENTS.md).
Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for the repository contract and
[START_HERE.md](START_HERE.md) for executable onboarding.

Use `.agents/skill_manifest.json`, `.agents/operations_manifest.json`,
and `.agents/state/` for shared discovery and local memory. This file remains
a compatibility pointer for existing Cursor workspaces.
